Warranty and safety
-------------------
This software is experimental. Incorrect USB power wiring (especially missing
VBUS isolation on the goggles→Pi link) can damage hardware. Stopping the
raw-gadget service while goggles are still attached can wedge the Pi USB
controller until reboot. Use at your own risk. See the project README.
